:"chapter-001","block":"b-b55e52dce3d59a3bbee9","layer":"original","quote":"八年春三月〖2〗，攻其郭〖3〗；乃出战。击，大破之，谭、尚夜遁。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":477,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":32},{"id":"wudi-q-o091","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-d36d066801c8ec76926c","layer":"original","quote":"冬十月，到黎阳，为子整与谭结婚〖8〗。﹝二﹞尚闻公北，乃释平原，还邺。东平吕旷、吕翔叛尚，屯阳平〖9〗；率其众降，封为列侯。﹝三﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":491,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":65},{"id":"wuwen-q-2bd78f956b15778dca64","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-4b8511d148a6bf9f3000","layer":"original","quote":"二十三年薨〖1〗。无子。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":184,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":26,"end":38},{"id":"wuwen-q-3a5860ce4f2820813433","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-4b8511d148a6bf9f3000","layer":"original","quote":"黄初二年，追进爵，谥曰戴公。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":184,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":38,"end":52},{"id":"wuwen-q-657d8d7d7522edbea3ad","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-4b8511d148a6bf9f3000","layer":"original","quote":"郿戴公子整，奉从叔父郎中绍后。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":184,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":15},{"id":"wuwen-q-c2f55f326342aebf012b","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-87027621c423a4f13bd6","layer":"original","quote":"武皇帝二十五男：卞皇后生文皇帝、任城威王彰、陈思王植、萧怀王熊；刘夫人生丰愍王昂、相殇王铄；环夫人生邓哀王冲、彭城王据、燕王宇；杜夫人生沛穆王林、中山恭王衮；秦夫人生济阳怀王玹、陈留恭王峻；尹夫人生范阳闵王矩；王昭仪生赵王幹；孙姬生临邑殇公子上、楚王彪、刚殇公子勤；李姬生谷城殇公子乘、郿戴公子整、灵殇公子京；周姬生樊安公均；刘姬生广宗殇公子棘；宋姬生东平灵王徽；赵姬生乐陵王茂。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":190},{"id":"wuwen-q-e30470241bc76163c855","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-4b8511d148a6bf9f3000","layer":"original","quote":"建安二十二年，封郿侯。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":184,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":15,"end":26}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
